<title>UK: Deutsche Bank sets warrants on the DAX index.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank sets warrants on the DAX index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG has issued 10 million American-style call and put warrants, in nine equal tranches, on the DAX index, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 28.JUL.97-19.JUN.98   PAYDATE	28.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT, DUSS	 SPOT REF     4149.36</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p>TYPE    STRIKE    ISSUE	 GEARING    PREMIUM</p>
<p>CALL    4200	4.08 DEM    10.17 X    11.05 PCT</p>
<p>CALL    4300	3.61 DEM    11.49 X    12.33 PCT</p>
<p>CALL    4400	3.17 DEM    13.09 X    13.68 PCT</p>
<p>CALL    4500	2.78 DEM    14.93 X    15.15 PCT</p>
<p>CALL    4800	1.83 DEM    22.67 X    20.09 PCT</p>
<p>PUT     4100	3.03 DEM    13.69 X    8.49 PCT</p>
<p>PUT     4200	3.49 DEM    11.89 X    7.19 PCT</p>
<p>PUT     4300	3.96 DEM    10.48 X    5.91 PCT</p>
<p>PUT     4400	4.47 DEM    9.28 X     4.73 PCT</p>
<p>NOTES	     </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
